  "content": "\n\n<p>本材质包对方块进行了重新贴图，并将其名称更改为“后室”主题材质。</p>\n<p>截至目前，已包含第 37 层：泳池回廊（The Poolrooms）与第 0 层：教程/原始后室（The Tutorial/OG Backrooms）的方块。</p>\n<p>本材质包完全原生兼容，无需任何额外依赖，旨在尽可能方便大家使用。</p>\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>已更改的方块：</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>发光浆果</li>\n<li>杜鹃花 + 开花杜鹃花</li>\n<li>石英矿石</li>\n<li>所有石英方块</li>\n<li>海晶石方块</li>\n<li>橡木方块</li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>（我真的记不太清了，大概就这些）</strong></span>\n<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>截图使用的着色器：</strong></span>\n<p>Complementary Unbound：https:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound</a></p>\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>目前已重做的方块：</strong></span>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1258863/description_06f9ed53-6901-4813-8d67-79741109f35b.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> Poolrooms（泳池回廊）：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098108/description_07c20612-069a-4df0-b26f-57e4ab665a29.png\" width=\"597\" height=\"319\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098108/description_13a9c8df-5ca7-4a3b-8ab1-9c1cba09a5f9.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"319\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098108/description_a8e671e5-ad1f-4aae-a008-c92327f10712.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"319\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098108/description_7de7fa82-36cd-4c38-9d56-ed9f01da6059.png\" width=\"597\" height=\"320\"></p>",
